{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12172","headline":"登玉山诸峰偶至悟真寺 · 钱起","name":"登玉山诸峰偶至悟真寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郭南云水佳，讼简野情发。\n紫芝每相引，黄绶不能緤。\n稍入石门幽，始知灵境绝。\n冥搜未寸晷，仙迳俄九折。\n蟠木盖石梁，崩岸露云穴。\n数峰拔崑仑，秀色与空澈。\n玉气交晴虹，桂花留曙月。\n半岩采珉者，一点如片雪。\n真赏无前程，奇观宁暂辍。\n更闻东林磬，可听不可说。\n兴中寻觉化，寂尔诸象灭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}